{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/165462-the-guardian-world-of-darkness-the-inside-story-on-the-death-of-a-game","id":165462,"title":"The Guardian: \"World of Darkness - the inside story on the death of a game\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-10T18:25:18-07:00","id":165462,"title":"The Guardian: \"World of Darkness - the inside story on the death of a game\"","content":"The Guardian published an in-depth article on the failure of the World of Darkness MMO and the final dissolution of CCP Atlanta / White Wolf. It's a fun read! My favorite bit is below:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Most of the sources spoken to for this piece identified the same problematic CCP manager, who had little vision for what the finished game would look like.</span></span></span> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cNot once could he answer any question about moment-to-moment gameplay or areas of focus,\u201d says one source. \u201cInstead, he preferred to deliver buzzword-laden rambles\u2026 It was not uncommon for him to communicate in onomatopoeia.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;I once saw him looking over the shoulder of a programmer at some bit of User Interface the poor guy had hacked together. He straightened up, put fingers to lips and said, \u2018No, this isn't it at all. Make it more...<i>psssshhhh</i>\u2019 He hissed on his fucking fingertips, like the air coming out of a bicycle tire, and then just walked away.&quot;</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div><br /> With managers like that, who needs competitors?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2969-mord","name":"Mord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2969_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T18:35:56-07:00","id":165470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo\"> On the MMO - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/160133-on-the-mmo </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> This might be of interest to some. http://www.theguardian.com/technology/2014/jun/05/world-of-darkness-the-inside-story-mmo-ccp-white-wolf </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T18:41:48-07:00","id":165472,"title":"","content":"Whoops, I didn't think to look for an oWoD thread in the Off-Topic 